# Input

```css
@supports (not at-rule(@property)) { .fallback { color:red; } }
@supports (not (display:grid)) { .fallback { display:block; } }
@supports (at-rule(@property)) { .supported { color:green; } }

```


# Options

```json
{
  "css": { "formatter": { "delimiterSpacing": true } }
}
```

# Formatted

```css
@supports ( not at-rule( @property ) ) {
	.fallback {
		color: red;
	}
}
@supports ( not ( display: grid ) ) {
	.fallback {
		display: block;
	}
}
@supports ( at-rule( @property ) ) {
	.supported {
		color: green;
	}
}

```
